  "blocks": [
    { "type": "explanation", "markdown": "**Avere** (to have) is also irregular:\n\nio **ho** · tu **hai** · lui/lei **ha** · noi **abbiamo** · voi **avete** · loro **hanno**\n\nItalian uses *avere* idiomatically where English uses \"to be\": **avere fame** (to be hungry), **avere sete** (to be thirsty), **avere caldo/freddo** (to be hot/cold), and **avere ... anni** (to be ... years old)." },
